Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:59:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] exe: show every letter of the pixel font, show stat
 numbers, stop the error chime

- Pixel-font text is never trimmed with "..." (the font draws it as "_") or
  clipped; it shrinks to fit instead. This fixes "M_ ANZ_" and "RESTART AS A_".
- Stat boxes get a taller value area, so the numbers are no longer cut off,
  and show "-" until a scan fills them in.
- The output box is unlocked only while text is written. A read-only
  RichTextBox plays the Windows error sound whenever text is deleted, which
  happened on every progress line (Checking Megabase 3 / 40 ...).
