Subject: [PATCH 2/2] exe: pick the launcher with buttons under Start scan

Seven buttons: All launchers, Minecraft Launcher, CurseForge, Modrinth App,
Prism / MultiMC, Lunar Client and Other folder (opens a folder picker). The
choice is passed to the script's -Launcher, or -Path for Other folder. The
buttons are only active for Mod Analyzer and Full Screenshare, and turn into
two columns when the window is short. Stop live watch now takes Start's place
during a watch, so the left column has room.
